ok   normalize rewrites every non-canonical datetime once, leaves canonical rows, and is idempotent
ok   normalized values sort with Rails-format values by time
ok   a table without an id column is normalized by rowid
ok   a duplicated id does not make one row overwrite another
ok   WITHOUT ROWID tables and tables declaring _rowid_ are reported and left untouched
ok   a cell that only looks canonical to LIKE is rewritten and a canonical one is left alone
ok   reserved-word and odd table and column names are quoted
ok   a datetime(6) column is normalized like DATETIME
8 tests, 40 assertions, 0 failures
